			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 250290101,
					"content": "乖乖喔，不要灰心，只要你身體好了，然後…加油學習！一定很快就可以爬到山頂的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290102,
					"content": "嗚嗚…嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290103,
					"content": "你是不是肚子餓了？嗯…那我去拿點吃的給你喔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290104,
					"content": "嗚…嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290105,
					"content": "你在做什麼啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290106,
					"content": "我在陪我的夥伴奇卡玩哦。雖然牠還很小，但我媽媽說牠長大以後一定會和其他匿葉龍一樣厲害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290107,
					"content": "嗚…嗚嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290108,
					"content": "不要難過了，你只是身體太虛弱，之前還受過傷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290109,
					"content": "媽媽說只要你多吃好吃的，然後和我一起多多鍛煉，一定會好起來的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290110,
					"content": "嗚？嗚嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290111,
						250290113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290111,
					"content": "（摸摸奇卡。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290112,
					"content": "嗚嗚…嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290119,
					"content": "唉呀，說了這麼多話，馬上就要鍛煉了，先吃點東西好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290120,
					"content": "這是我媽媽特製的果乾哦。先在大鍋裡炒啊炒，然後加入很多香香的調味料…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290121,
					"content": "而且還要加好多糖和花瓣…總之，味道很好喔！我這就給你，欸？…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290122,
					"content": "我的果乾呢？明明放在包包裡啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290123,
					"content": "…嗚，嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290124,
					"content": "嗚哇！奇卡！難道都被你偷吃了？都說了不要這麼貪吃，吃太多就跑不動了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290125,
					"content": "唔唔，嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290126,
						250290127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290126,
					"content": "有食慾是好事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290128,
					"content": "嗚嗚，嗚嗚嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290129,
					"content": "是這樣嗎？那…我也要和奇卡一樣，吃好多東西，快快長大，然後幫媽媽的忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290130,
					"content": "好，那我們就開始鍛煉吧，奇卡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290131,
					"content": "嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290132,
					"content": "我看看喔…那今天就訓練一下登山吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290133,
					"content": "嗚，嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290134,
					"content": "還是和上次一樣，不會很難的。打起精神來啊，奇卡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290135,
					"content": "…嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290136,
					"content": "對了，亞瓦爾叔叔上次和我說如果想要正經訓練的話，就需要找到一個適當的「訓練目標」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290137,
					"content": "要是我可以找到一個很厲害的冒險家，請他幫我制訂目標就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290138,
						250290139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290138,
					"content": "我是個滿厲害的冒險家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290140,
					"content": "#真的？那…{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}，{F#妳}{M#你}願意幫我嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290141,
						250290142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290141,
					"content": "要我帶著你們爬山嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290143
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290143,
					"content": "#不是不是，如果{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}真的那麼厲害，我們是追不上的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290144,
					"content": "#我們會在地上看著{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}，算好時間的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290145,
					"content": "#拜託{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}使出全力，以最快的速度爬上山頂吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290146,
					"content": "嗚！嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290142,
					"content": "好，跟著我，現在就開始！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290143
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290139,
					"content": "厲害的冒險家就在你身邊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290127,
					"content": "吃得多長得壯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290113,
					"content": "牠是怎麼受傷的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250290114,
					"content": "我不知道…也許媽媽知道！但媽媽把奇卡帶回來的時候，牠就已經生病了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290115,
					"content": "奇卡吃不下東西，也沒力氣動，我只能每天把藥加進水裡，然後餵牠喝下去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290116,
					"content": "雖然奇卡最後病好了，但是…牠的身體很虛弱，沒辦法像其他的匿葉龍一樣在懸崖旁邊竄來竄去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290117,
					"content": "牠因為這件事一直很難過，所以我想要幫牠！讓牠恢復健康，然後…變得比其他匿葉龍還要強！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特拉忒"
				},
				{
					"id": 250290118,
					"content": "嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250290119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇卡"
				}
			]
		},
